 75ZN c  2011Il01: {+75}Cu beam produced from fission of {+238}U                
 75ZN2c  with protons at Holifield Radioactive Ion beam facility. Mass          
 75ZN3c  and isobaric separation of the beam with a high-resolution system.     
 75ZN4c  Measured E|g, I|g, |g|g and |b|g coin, isotopic half-life using four   
 75ZN5c  HPGe Clover Ge detectors for |g rays and two plastic scintillators for 
 75ZN6c  |b particles. Level scheme deduced from detailed |g|g coin data        
 75ZN cB IB$ 2011Il01 list only strong |b feedings to 345, 420, 476, 725, 1144, 
 75ZN2cB and 2906 levels. Others are deduced by the evaluators. These feedings  
 75ZN3cB should be considered as apparent values since about 35% |b feeding     
 75ZN4cB remains unaccounted. Note that |g rays with uncertain placements are   
 75ZN5cB not included by the evaluators in obtaining intensity balances         
 75ZN cB LOGFT$ Deduced by the evaluators using log| {Ift} code. Due to         
 75ZN2cB incomplete decay scheme, these values should be considered as          
 75ZN3cB approximate, thus no uncertainties are listed here                     
 75ZN cB IB(A)$ 1.8 {I4} in 2011Il01                                            
 75ZN cB IB(B)$ 7.9 {I17} in 2011Il01 for feeding to 2904.6+2906.5 levels       
 75ZN cG RI$ Uncertainties quoted in 2011Il01 are statistical only, as          
 75ZN2cG communicated to the evaluators by the first author in an e-mail reply. 
 75ZN3cG The evaluators have assigned minimum of 1% uncertainty to take into    
 75ZN4cG account systematic uncertainties arising from efficiency calibration   
 75ZN5cG and peak fitting procedures                                            
 75ZN cG TI(D)$ From intensity balance at 152 level. There may be direct |b     
 75ZN2cG feeding also which is not taken into account (evaluators' comment)     
 75ZN cG E(E)$ Poor fit, level-energy difference=1754.5                         
 75ZN cG RI(F)$ Uncertainty quoted as 0.6 in 2011Il01 seems a misprint. The     
 75ZN2cG evaluators assign 0.06                                                 
 75ZN cL E$ From least-squares fit to E|g data. Reduced |h{+2}=1.0              
 75ZN cL E(X)$ Two levels at 2904.7 and 2906.5 are proposed by the evaluators   
 75ZN2cL based on |g-ray fits in the level scheme, and agreed upon by the       
 75ZN3cL first author of 2011Il01 in an e-mail reply                            
